{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 898,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2958c5d558c34509b18d33c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练我已经做完啦～。\\n这是我潜心打磨出的成果……请您拭目以待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f011ba290b8a89133228215e359e45c73608410b4c4416b58a4d67e5de010577",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cddbe8b58ff73d189cb937c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哦！好啦，接下来轮到你了。\\n你准备好适合我现在实力的菜单了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ce2489e0e17aee2f65c42dbed5808375be9a72dd2b0653668f982386097d26c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9ca7cd5776cb3f6df87d394",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练也做完了，我打算品尝您给的低糖甜点……\\n顺便向您汇报成果，要一起喝杯茶吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5132231752f962e0b93e106f55f7bc8f2bc86991bda6d66e22269f440d49369",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6967697b1c8e7f4bf3a2b044",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练也～……完毕！成长！大爆走——！\\n神鹰已经变得最强了，就在您的眼前尽情展示吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b54fd8b3f75b9608b0a98f6b812a8f2575d2124a10a4612a2e5c2ad4846571e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fd706b0076eeb05256bbee8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你竟然错过了我努力进行自主训练的美丽身姿……？\\n无需忧虑，来看看我现在如花般绽放的模样吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8a948ed7c0cf1575a1ac5dce90d10993d13c9357f1de093d66f8ecda9f796a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8edfa049e36e4017ef4630b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过自主训练，我的獠牙已打磨锋利。\\n那么，猎场在哪里？——别让我等太久了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de0d3a4bf7f86c7a68a2e35a89acf32bb69d7224ccdbceac7d0e96003891a341",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ea5621e7be4510888935f44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "专心致志……自主训练已经结束了。\\n关于结果我也想听听你的意见，你意下如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b040b05a4fd9d8a37d220c3c6b130cb30534afd99ad4f1a62ea10922680c408",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7720d8f3268339d167ffb734",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练已经结束了。接下来的指示还没好吗？\\n这是你的工作，给我完美地完成它。……你能做到的对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b16c2af0ace91190f5cfa2dd9a8dcd20c59f4c82ce64642a29c01ea3ea8a30cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bf81327cfc36cdc93dc20df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在推们包围下的自主训练，进展非常顺利……！\\n接下来要不要聊聊推……不对，共享一下情报？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cf770a0728318acf34ae2ba9e5062ea70c02672c19b290ca55a6a4f1c363707",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a085ecf8e36db4508203dec1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个星云酱，竟然做完了自主训练……！\\n这份疲惫，光靠我自己可是没法治愈的啊～……（偷瞄）。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea915db9cbe1e07f9b12f5364257a48c66fb72dc2cef9af5d9b6eac8b339ecbd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:311f290b19cc2ed1ec369a11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好耶！自主训练做完啦！不过还是直接\\n让你来指导更能让人燃起来啊。快点来吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d74bb3790a5606206475d80ecdd4d691896af69bafc48a5f9b935e8175f2de4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2842f9f4cecd5a80726a4b78",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束！因为努力过了，今天的拉面\\n肯定格外美味吧。呵呵，要一起去吃吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6412fb2355f7878f14605eb527380845d98a654265a0ae519d447a92a4c3223",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4287f1e92380f9f3324b6427",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，你制定的自主训练菜单果然名不虚传。\\n离胜利的方程式又近了一步。请让我详细为你解说一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bcea3055014678d3c3682ad723adb304fc642a915502e439c80a0cf52a200a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3f83da06b208753895d1b7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练，结～束☆训练员，\\nMaya，又变得更成熟了哦～♪快来看看嘛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef84faed320f96005f8bea31e11373a956f5de4b972a4e19f82fec101eab451a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5cb4feaab9e3b0bee3921ae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你的工作结束了吗……？这边自主训练已经完成了。\\n我现在和『朋友』一起去接你，可以吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf877535f4b3fc597a3ef72e35e66b4dada7485bdb185294c7b96b4ea0ebcc2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70b5909cfdf485288435ae54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "行动『自主训练』，完毕。请确认成果\\n是否与预测数据存在差异。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d32d360fbfaf3e3fcc1b6cd5f24e40fa2e6b9ecd6393f180769473f4833d1c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96e50ad047698150caf03ba7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过自主训练，我全身的肌肉都泵血膨胀起来了！\\n请务必来看看我这千锤百炼的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b4398ec3305c7da629daf00efc162256c270bfec149ddeb835a097643b3ab5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02a571adc00b205836533673",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练之后，果然还是要Buono地补充营养才行！\\n训练员也来一边聊天，一边和我一起吃吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "47df83dbe8262e2b8abcb0151d19ff91fcec39e0f431df681354282993d865c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9de79cbc04405f1059a6a310",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束啦！哪怕只有一点点，\\n我也希望你能看看……我是不是离帅气的赛马娘更近了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b8d8f8959e181a6eb4ff08f58cf5e66d02f3132a4033f04b870363a172a63d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e0d241474a1f05429e000ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自、自主训练结束了……！米浴，也许……\\n稍微成长了一点点呢。下、下次我也会努力的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d63459e549e1276cab16c13404e2b6ea2c56c098a94280712dbf586b5647632d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35592773793731babca681c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束！你那边有空了就过来哦！\\n我也给你准备了体力恢复条，正等着你呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc64e5ba49920d10e7b355756384c809709b392734a0c2796e6df4fae0f1476d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5557fce21a218ebfc85fcf00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哟。来吧，盛大地慰劳我一下吧。\\n红茶里请加10块方糖。……拜——托——啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7004814d659023a6a9b36ba14d4807955e082aca9a09e88b7e2a8295f4002e12",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cab68eb0b1dfe32ace05642",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "主题：自主训练已完成\\n请共享关于接下来的日程安排。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3fec82257c60f003b23fc5dd0ee3d18d98bfd2e7b9f88353367e47bfed23bcd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e8ddb63ba20f3a60f9a6ce4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哟！你这段时间是\\n怎么过的啊？快过来讲给我听听吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3577f8d1669af60c9ad492f606af9867e2d0c812f9024aee0e5996b3129593a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e438418489d1d994a07275a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练，结束啦————！\\n但是，我还能继续跑！一起努力吧啊啊啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b59994d6c70a5c241a06d5b1fa1cadd00b09a698a25d584da2e0914b4a999ea7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e378d090b2ee64fbec0e72f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束。结果已经整理好了。\\n要来的话就搞快点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1740928f76ea81559ae0c7b8c38ffd45dbce60796d9120b13438964265546a97",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c6e4f9e1d99e6a3c327b0a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练已顺利结束。接下来的日程\\n也准备完毕了，您可以回来了吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea237ec283cc15476023ac2cb590c508d7fa81786439b8edb3a7e0fef510ca74",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2bd2ca2758970624bf715f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿♪ 机伶，今天也努力了哦。\\n#自主训练 #汇报 #奖励 #好想要♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "0466da3d525d83b77a4eea821aeb71416fc0bf5be9b6f95d4d1df99d3498131b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bacb738f64c068db8856e568",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "公主☆自主训练，完成了哦！\\n接下来的菜单也要一☆二☆喝——！！地拿下哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d363fce00967948b63af4574679ebb25ab4e0de3765ebbd2008fb75b33c5c871",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87da85458d16e518cc57db25",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了。所以，接下来的行程呢？\\n我还得联系经纪人，你快点回来啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cc24637ebc19d5cf6a9c41bae7bceaddf826df626e07cb75102890e6d69b303",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4ea888d8c99bf92a0e2ca55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练我也以爆速完成了！\\n来吧来吧，请下达下一个指示！无论什么我都会蓦进前行的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c14d6ccae9b7f012b64eeffac8db7948cc56f990561faaa207de9aace061b188",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4760631a2ee8e6484f469ee8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过自主训练磨砺出的，这份光辉……！\\n你也一定会感到惊讶的♪来吧，Come on！And Look！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cf0b6f5b13a54019efe207d1789fc6312a59c551476377886bfafcd2d6e2942",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0dbc49e69a77d16eda1751a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了，闲得发慌啦～！再不快点来，\\n我就要把你桌上的东西全咬烂哦～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0cabb46301b742cdcc4e54befd94537fe63b01c22d25c8b1270df54b3651d08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a712bc4a4e588a4b679fb5b5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哦！非得等我联系你才过来，\\n明明只是个使魔还挺嚣张的嘛！快点过来——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "916a328d3ce1c724efd271c0f841c4f9993c30c8b71f8cacc6eb7f7eda78c8af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1044"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cd446bab5e3231f1cbbe35b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练，结束了哦～。我会一边摸着\\n大家的头说“乖哦乖哦”，一边等您回来呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b082758453a781b3ffb3096b3b17c7df7abe1cbcace4c0e3792638549eff882",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1045"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70e752ec89da259d505586b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "闪亮亮！自主训练，冲线☆啦！\\n飞鹰子崭新的光芒，想看吗～？（想看～！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa2f2c6e759bc4bee5f808814368cd912b4c6d98c96143860dc0b239b9f9ad5e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd40ac7e479bde03b1ff968e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『勇者完成了提升自我的锻炼。接下来\\n只需等待贤者的建言即可（第12卷327页）』",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e224615f2df0c8e324a05d4fe25f3438ec782afee71ab7a1a7a85d350ccd1ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77c90b71db7aff56d7b69e77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束～。我可是超认真的，\\n你过来请我吃点甜的呗？拜托啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58a6504381b4667c71de71cd7bc4e46c35bbecc40b1695d6d2cd82e9a1e412a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26a3dfe5474088e824742b08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练的话已经做完了——唉。\\n自己一个人根本算不上胜负啊……你，什么时候来？",
      "source_fingerprint": "022a329fa73c7015bb97a7226023bc6e2ac0a3f2aa368986bbcaad3693c795b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fbfc79b4af8d9fa14d89907",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……自主训练结束了。姑且汇报一声。\\n现在的我，应该足以让那些看扁我的人刮目相看了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4b5f551e3093096ac4514f1c97b2f790c23d1057b746795ad4603582f404f86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccc6ab93c39901daddd91d28",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，自主训练结束了！\\n嘿嘿……我从花蕾，绽放成花朵了吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a40e8d7fe47bd159c0a98b2121a002e25fa53b9361c3ba8b9d18e2394a0c5eb5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3740b23410c3631e08c1c681",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "乌啦啦～♪自主训练结束了哦！\\n好想让训练员快点看看我变强的地方呀～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2ea5cd87f5268e320329aff42930a603f36a6b5e59084b3a19ec19a3fae9ead",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d98a7ed8d64a1f885ff53612",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哟！咕～，内心太火热了，\\n跃跃欲试的呢……！我该怎么办才好啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1716da3d1ba2138d735f62d8b91c282a7bb17bcddc9d03dd9569c90afafd9fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3cc10369c3b5735a7e8a7b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完毕！英雄必须时刻锻炼自己才行啊！\\n下次我也会努力的～！训练员，快来为我应援吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a66c8a874c7ad16205e9368c2f7f55aadfde6f37f27cc1bd0f92c45bdcbb71b8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00075d4262d7352ca61c6972",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了，美妙绝伦☆汗水的光芒也美妙绝伦★\\n如果训练员能夸奖我的话……那就太～美～妙～啦☆★☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "199eae06c87306ab447b0f287447af7f15231aed7d4016a629eed18874b36316",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f6c8004b8ef6d3110b5fce6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呼哦哦！我全力进行完『自主训练』了哦！\\n毕竟这可是今天的幸运行动呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1008da9b73416f73ee7ef46d9d41acf1e6ad3b2b21c89ce968e86c6d8f804916",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca58c9eb27f9368ac854fdf5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了，去吊床里睡会儿吧。\\n你也在你想来的时候过来就行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcdc81013acc68e56645f14c756f5a52ea766c555a44553981987611ac362a3a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41b07eb1a72a2877e920c6b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈哇……呼……自主训练，总算是做完了～。\\n犯迷糊的次数……比平时少了些……我可能，成长了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "40571bc915134e3ca7f5cf9977fc44fda8309e321474a187c63bb426db675bf5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a86e0dcbfe68e3cccebd0d16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个，自主训练结束了。\\n……要决定接下来的安排了吧？快点回来哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "041bf41f0e2eea2d3ffb3805313ee32b703f24dea3970046275608ff77b3185d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90754da529bb8514f39a0d02",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员——，自主训练我已经做完了哦。\\n不过嘛，自己一个人的话总会有极限的……你懂的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cb37c76dcb82ed10923d0febc94cef4ab115c1b7577c85fb1240a44ad5992b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84e9bde1f362b6c6d4c01e13",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一流的赛马娘，可是能完美完成自主训练的哦！\\n好啦，快点过来吧。我赐予你慰劳本王（King）的权利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16e6aa85c3c77686c3977ece78bbd6aea47485903f94788a317e8d92e26da7fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa29ddbaea83333786c34039",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当当呼呼！自主训练完毕！\\n训练的成果，我要姆姆地展示给你看哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f464b34283b56cb24e16a8e90c8c3ffd7004e1193e77dd38b07560d30219bbda",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe778e93323e2c16575247ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了。我会把结果整理好，\\n等您一回来我们就一起调整接下来的菜单吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "feb6ebfab50954821bf2d7706df48436cea654a50393f7873d9d27318384cda9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d061c58e0622552d25e00cfc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完毕！去喝杯冰沙吧。\\n你觉得如何？要不要和善信一起喝个茶？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5ca08f980f1f2f79a3281ff689e51a44eaa4817fc7d94e81af06d7f721489b2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c25a37517c9a7beb44d6a1b6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "LANE：小太阳神\\n自主训练搞定　求认真回复",
      "source_fingerprint": "d86de4d32083c814b8e5afeb6d52da6db7e481b667e6ae2246452353bd0e063d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2749aa84a0fe2e3f5d419b93",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练我已经搞定了哦——！！……嗯～～，\\n努力之后变得好困啊……呼——……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ffc7ce6ff013261bdb37e9df56a4fa32cb4dfd3eb7fe79df676bb9c6560d60",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b771960f9b173d4eba916d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了！所以说，绕圈跑步时\\n看到的那条可疑小巷……我们要不要一起去突击一下？",
      "source_fingerprint": "200c0712e211e11fb9326abca0b1bc3e75307b775540bc2aa1bdef0b20354ef6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1067"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b9c108b0674704bd3474164",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，自主训练结束了哦～！\\n好想让您看看成果！我可以去接您吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba10d7854e8c49d4ebdeec98bca11f84e5bcb2da7feabf72ae7ebdebdecc3e61",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8a7636039331118a052701e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完毕，自我评价是满分小红花♪\\n开玩笑的……嘿嘿。请您务必来确认一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "219f0bdc9860dab10fb98aafa1f194449f98b88e2858d9784b622398f0701a37",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96897fcfe81fe12a69b55b1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完毕。……好了小狗。\\n想知道内容的话，就给我直接回房。听明白了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4cd7b13dcf1da1be0568923efcb5edc7550a11f2bde980a67c911261e0e67ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d666f4712f6c715c0f4a8e48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练已经结束了。\\n我会一边仔细地做着放松运动一边等您的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9bdf3faf4a357d92dc63da884e2ba2bca115ef5126757ed9f03a0e9b656a78a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74709b87efe79310e8d95142",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完成了……然而，修行之路依然漫长！\\n请您指出需要改善的地方！押忍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "feebf21ead196cafc450a4e933c38f27a09c18374daa9f4b152d5589cd7d6813",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:624b8768b77dd832d9c87bee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呼……呼……自、自主训练！全部完成了！\\n好想快点给您看看我变强了多——……咳咳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d97072b29776a9ea987b721730b647d9a8c5b7cb9c39044069c204533dc201c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf0f713858b5b7ead5faecd1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哦～。在训练员大人\\n到来之前，我会悠哉地等着的～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7704300c00feb443618ca910feba1f6d9ed1a3bbbd2a3e88f4ef5426329c610",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4542a4ce3668522a7b39e1b6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完成了！呵呵……没关系的，我并没有\\n勉强自己哦。如果担心的话……就请直接来确认吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "405fb56e0cb95c8e1bbe201a645c7773f17abb33d224416af81cee5d4a215cdc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6ed798a7a3e3b15c0a5e25b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个，自主训练结束了！……我把做得好的地方和\\n不好的地方都记录下来了，请您确认一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b874265b5793b3f0bd9160d35db618f54fae06c52a8e3db6ec5455f7630e8dd9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0303cc2a5ee3d9ae7076e05f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了，此刻，此身宛如乘时之风……\\n微风吹拂的尽头，能请您见证到最后吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "432e6a1542412b0443548292f6cfe1a599d9c14f14f5cf7d07fb0245b01845db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:383f0ddcdde8159c9a43696b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，请快点过来……！自主训练做完后，\\n我要应付中央的女孩子们的邀请已经是极限了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f0c6c31f9361ad7e1397d9151cdd8f6d932c174b87e514f97b3ba8f031ea2e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:447cfdf1070877ce8a89c56a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哟。话说，之后去看场电影咋样？\\n那绝对是一部超级B级片！所以，才想和你一起看嘛",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a96319d579b5cd357ee0c52629c5d268c2cf6f3ce64ef8912edfa12a1818ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9256fed8005356a4388d534f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哦。这样一来就能把所有人远远甩开了对吧？\\n我现在可是超强的哦！？你这家伙也快点过来被吓一跳吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cda8d36004235cdc436a973e2bef23354afc53812664de87e01386be98d728a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:658515e63697d8fe3ade5481",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我用自己的方式安排了训练内容的自主训练，\\n究竟绽放出了怎样的光辉呢……请一定要来看哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e8e5be2d9a888af5d0dc5506b8965dbeaf3a889da575e19f9e873fdce8465a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7da1e4556ff91c0f8f1c15f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练——完毕。\\n待机中。希望将成果——传达给你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c26dd7180718b907ce0e7bba9f12ddfbfaebd8f10b67311a1bd72debbfaec262",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38ab5f35035e118acf0003c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵——自主训练……与全新自我的调和非常完美。\\n……来吧训练员。这一杯，可是格外美味的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fb76ff2722ba305dec3546c7362ebb607e9c1e3894187a95a96468128079646",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1084"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93edb628f69ceb99d4ac3094",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练顺利完成。在确定接下来的安排之前，\\n我会仔细审视自己应当优先完成的事项。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed9b0c702b692c55e9e57b67f842308da0f5170f220778461ada344a9d184467",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1085"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2129588e6a5c52420df4b899",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了。\\n这翻涌而出的爱的去向……能请你快点告诉我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "494e8ac2bd9542a9e269cf3ee2e88d14f0e1dee746ad3ed9f12bf8ec93c9a729",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e48dd1a3a33fdf0583cf141e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咳咳。这里是结束了自主训练，非常了不起的真弓酱哦。\\n我努力的成果，你不来看看吗？……（盯）。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f22c4db1f02cdaead3522a5c74b85c075a564f40d651033d91c91df1ee1c532",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb8a5d886a573e6dbc7d3307",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完成啦♪当然结果是没问题的……我虽然想\\n这么说——但为了以防万一，还是拜托你也检查一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f3982ca0030d7034d013a1b3ab421e7d10590853f3acb2876684c47a380431a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1088"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd65097470c816262d30d70b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自、自主训练，结束了……。那个，\\n接下来要做什么……啊，完全不着急的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a608e6785d7f75a3580fc951b86c47f5a737327c86081ef742ddab65041c478",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1089"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3829a948384c62a02cf93c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完毕了。距离配得上『顶点』之名的女王，\\n我究竟靠近了多少……您能来确认一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0f99ffef47003e908a276f54ed80958ad9094ba398265d458c042e3e86e340b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1090"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f598e62c3c11907f6dca594",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呐呐，我的自主训练超～级努力了哦♪\\n训练员酱，你有什么话想对我说吧？对～吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac6dd888ee47cae2f4cad26083377e5972073b2a9a41b0984339ff95bc3d375d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1091"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
